OL,3,ATrump, Xi and Putin set to hold
OL,4,Ahistoric meeting on Apec sidelines
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has said both
OL,7,Fhe and Chinese leader Xi Jinping want
OL,8,Fto see an end to the Ukraine war, ahead
OL,9,Fof a historic trilateral meeting with
OL,10,FRussian President Vladimir Putin on the
OL,11,Fsidelines of the Asia-Pacific Economic
OL,12,FCo-operation (Apec) summit in China
OL,14,FThe three-way way talks will mark the
OL,15,Ffirst time the leaders of these
OL,16,Fcountries have held a formal meeting;
OL,17,Fread how the meeting is an opportunity
OL,18,Ffor the Chinese leader to exude power
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
